# Adsorptive denitrogenation of model fuels with porous metal-organic frameworks (MOFs): Effect of acidity and basicity of MOFs

Imteaz Ahmed, Zubair Hasan, Nazmul Abedin Khan, Sung Hwa Jhung
Department of Chemistry and Green-Nano Materials Research Center, Kyungpook National University, Daegu 702-701, Republic of Korea
## a r t i c l e i n f o
Article history:   
Received 4 August 2012   
Received in revised form 6 September 2012   
